# CR 106.7: a luck counter changes Caverns' own output to a color. Inspecting it leaves its mana pool and tap unchanged.
[Bot1 Deck]
Exotic Orchard
Island x25
[Bot2 Deck]
Gemstone Caverns
Plains x25
[Actions]
Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Choose(Plains)
Bot1.Hand.Exotic Orchard.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Exotic Orchard.Activate(Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
? Bot2.Mana =
? Bot2.Battlefield.Gemstone Caverns.Tapped = false
[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Gemstone Caverns.Counters.Luck = 1
